h another system under stated conditions."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-software_eng-4-intermediate", "domain": "SOFTWARE_ENG", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best paraphrases the passage?", "context": "The new API response adds an optional field and remains compatible with existing clients that ignore unknown fields. Clients with strict schemas may require updates.", "options": ["Compatibility depends partly on how clients handle unknown fields.", "Adding a field is safe for every possible client.", "The passage says no checks are necessary.", "The passage requires every system to be publicly accessible."], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Ý được đoạn văn hỗ trợ: Compatibility depends partly on how clients handle unknown fields."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-software_eng-4-advanced", "domain": "SOFTWARE_ENG", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which claim goes beyond what the passage supports?", "context": "The new API response adds an optional field and remains compatible with existing clients that ignore unknown fields. Clients with strict schemas may require updates.", "options": ["Compatibility depends partly on how clients handle unknown fields.", "The passage discusses compatible.", "The passage describes a technical workflow or limitation.", "Adding a field is safe for every possible client."], "correctIndex": 3, "explanation": "Không thể suy ra nhận định: Adding a field is safe for every possible client. Đối chiếu điều kiện và giới hạn được nêu trong đoạn văn."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-software_eng-5-beginner", "domain": "SOFTWARE_ENG", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"where feasible\" mean?", "context": "The team automates repeated checks where feasible, but keeps manual review for ambiguous design decisions. Automation supports rather than replaces all judgment.", "options": ["when practical and possible", "even when impossible", "only after every release fails", "without considering the task"], "correctIndex": 0, "exp