raffic", "publish the same broken version again", "return to an earlier version"], "correctIndex": 3, "explanation": "Trong ngữ cảnh này, \"rollback\" mang nghĩa: return to an earlier version."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-devops-2-intermediate", "domain": "DEVOPS", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best paraphrases the passage?", "context": "After error rates increase, the operator rolls back to the previous release. The team separately checks whether database changes are also reversible.", "options": ["The passage says no checks are necessary.", "The passage requires every system to be publicly accessible.", "Reverting the application may require separate consideration of database changes.", "Application rollback automatically reverses all database changes."], "correctIndex": 2, "explanation": "Ý được đoạn văn hỗ trợ: Reverting the application may require separate consideration of database changes."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-devops-2-advanced", "domain": "DEVOPS", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which claim goes beyond what the passage supports?", "context": "After error rates increase, the operator rolls back to the previous release. The team separately checks whether database changes are also reversible.", "options": ["The passage describes a technical workflow or limitation.", "Application rollback automatically reverses all database changes.", "Reverting the application may require separate consideration of database changes.", "The passage discusses rollback."], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Không thể suy ra nhận định: Application rollback automatically reverses all database changes. Đối chiếu điều kiện và giới hạn được nêu trong đoạn văn."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-devops-3-beginner", "domain": "DEVOPS", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"immutable\" mean?", "context": "An immutable image is replaced rather than edited after deployment. To change the application, the team builds and deploys a new image.", "options": ["available without any permissions", "automatically free of vulnerabilities", "not modified after creation in the described workflow", "unable to be replaced"], "correctIndex": 2, "explanation": "Trong ngữ cảnh này, \"immutable\" mang nghĩa: not modified after creation in the described workflow."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-devops-3-intermediate", "domain": "DEVOPS", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best paraphrases the passage?", "context": "An immutable image is replaced rather than edited after deployment. To change the application, the team builds and deploys a new image.", "options": ["The passage requires every system to be publicly accessible.", "Application changes are delivered through a new image.", "An immutable image can never contain a security vulnerability.", "The passage says no checks are necessary."], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Ý được đoạn văn hỗ trợ: Application changes are delivered through a new image."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-devops-3-advanced", "domain": "DEVOPS", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which claim goes beyond what the passage supports?", "context": "An immutable image is replaced rather than edited after deployment. To change the application, the team builds and deploys a new image.", "options": ["An immutable image can never contain a security vulnerability.", "Application changes are delivered through a new image.", "The passage discusses immutable.", "The passage describes a technical workflow or limitation."], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Không thể suy ra nhận định: An immutable image can never contain a security vulnerability. Đối chiếu điều kiện và giới hạn được nêu trong đoạn văn."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-devops-4-beginner", "domain": "DEVOPS", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"drift\" mean?", "context": "Configuration drift occurs when a server is changed manually and no longer matches the declared configuration. The team compares actual state with its configuration files.", "options": ["a new password for an operator", "a difference between intended and actual configuration", "a reduction in response time", "a successful automated backup"], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Trong ngữ cảnh này, \"drift\" mang nghĩa: a difference between intended and actual configuration."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-devops-4-intermediate", "domain": "DEVOPS", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best paraphrases the passage?", "context": "Configuration drift occurs when a server is changed manually and no longer matches the declared configuration. The team compares actual state with its configuration files.", "options": ["Manual changes can cause actual state to diverge from declared state.", "Configuration files alone guarantee that no manual changes ever occur.", "The passage says no checks are necessary.", "The passage requires every system to be publicly accessible."], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Ý được đoạn văn hỗ trợ: Manual changes can cause actual state to diverge from declared state."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-devops-4-advanced", "domain": "DEVOPS", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which claim goes beyond what the passage supports?", "context": "Configuration drift occurs when a server is changed manually and no longer matches the declared configuration. The team compares actual state with its configuration files.", "options": ["Manual changes can cause actual state to diverge from declared state.", "The passage discusses drift.", "The passage describes a technical workflow or limitation.", "Configuration files alone guarantee that no manual changes ever occur."], "correctIndex": 3, "explanation": "Không thể suy ra nhận định: Configuration files alone guarantee that no manual changes ever occur. Đối chiếu điều kiện và giới hạn được nêu trong đoạn văn."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-devops-5-beginner", "domain": "DEVOPS", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"gradually\" mean?", "context": "The release is gradually exposed to a small share of users while errors are monitored. The team expands exposure only if the observed results meet its criteria.", "options": ["in stages rather than all at once", "without any monitoring", "after every user signs out", "with no possibility of stopping"], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Trong ngữ cảnh này, \"gradually\" mang nghĩa: in stages rather than all at once."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-devops-5-intermediate", "domain": "DEVOPS", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best paraphrases the passage?", "context": "The release is gradually exposed to a small share of users while errors are monitored. The team expands exposure only if the observed results meet its criteria.", "options": ["Success with a small sample guarantees success for all users.", "The passage says no checks are necessary.", "The passage requires every system to be publicly accessible.", "A staged release can be expanded after evaluating observed results."], "correctIndex": 3, "explanation": "Ý được đoạn văn hỗ trợ: A staged release can be expanded after evaluating observed results."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-devops-5-advanced", "domain": "DEVOPS", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which claim goes beyond what the passage supports?", "context": "The release is gradually exposed to a small share of users while errors are monitored. The team expands exposure only if the observed results meet its criteria.", "options": ["The passage discusses gradually.", "The passage describes a technical workflow or limitation.", "Success with a small sample guarantees success for all users.", "A staged release can be expanded after evaluating observed results."], "correctIndex": 2, "explanation": "Không thể suy ra nhận định: Success with a small sample guarantees success for all users. Đối chiếu điều kiện và giới hạn được nêu trong đoạn văn."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-1-beginner", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"elastic\" mean?", "context": "The service adds capacity when traffic rises and releases it when traffic falls. The team describes this arrangement as elastic. It does not reserve peak capacity for the whole year.", "options": ["able to expand and shrink with demand", "fixed at the same size forever", "available only during office hours", "stored on a single personal laptop"], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: able to expand and shrink with demand"}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-1-intermediate", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best summarizes the passage?", "context": "The service adds capacity when traffic rises and releases it when traffic falls. The team describes this arrangement as elastic. It does not reserve peak capacity for the whole year.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "Traffic changes cause the service to adjust its capacity.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Traffic changes cause the service to adjust its capacity."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-1-advanced", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which conclusion is supported by the passage?", "context": "The service adds capacity when traffic rises and releases it when traffic falls. The team describes this arrangement as elastic. It does not reserve peak capacity for the whole year.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The team avoids keeping unused peak capacity all year.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 2, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: The team avoids keeping unused peak capacity all year."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-2-beginner", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"variable expense\" mean?", "context": "The team pays for resources while it uses them instead of buying servers in advance. This changes a large upfront purchase into a variable expense. Usage is lower during quiet weeks.", "options": ["a payment that never changes", "a cost that changes with usage", "a purchase made before any usage", "a refund for every service request"], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: a cost that changes with usage"}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-2-intermediate", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best summarizes the passage?", "context": "The team pays for resources while it uses them instead of buying servers in advance. This changes a large upfront purchase into a variable expense. Usage is lower during quiet weeks.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The team pays according to its resource usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 2, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: The team pays according to its resource usage."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-2-advanced", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which conclusion is supported by the passage?", "context": "The team pays for resources while it uses them instead of buying servers in advance. This changes a large upfront purchase into a variable expense. Usage is lower during quiet weeks.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears.", "Quiet weeks can cost less because resource usage is lower."], "correctIndex": 3, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Quiet weeks can cost less because resource usage is lower."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-3-beginner", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"availability\" mean?", "context": "The application runs across separate locations so that one location can fail without stopping the entire service. The design improves availability. The team still monitors failures and tests recovery.", "options": ["the amount of source code stored", "the number of employees hired", "the ability to remain accessible when needed", "the speed of writing a password"], "correctIndex": 2, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: the ability to remain accessible when needed"}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-3-intermediate", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best summarizes the passage?", "context": "The application runs across separate locations so that one location can fail without stopping the entire service. The design improves availability. The team still monitors failures and tests recovery.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears.", "Separate locations help the service remain accessible during a failure."], "correctIndex": 3, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Separate locations help the service remain accessible during a failure."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-3-advanced", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which conclusion is supported by the passage?", "context": "The application runs across separate locations so that one location can fail without stopping the entire service. The design improves availability. The team still monitors failures and tests recovery.", "options": ["Using separate locations does not remove the need to test recovery.", "The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Using separate locations does not remove the need to test recovery."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-4-beginner", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"agility\" mean?", "context": "Developers can prepare temporary test environments quickly and remove them after an experiment. They no longer wait for a hardware purchase before every test. This improves agility.", "options": ["the need to keep every test server forever", "the process of printing purchase orders", "the practice of preventing experiments", "the ability to respond and experiment quickly"], "correctIndex": 3, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: the ability to respond and experiment quickly"}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-4-intermediate", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best summarizes the passage?", "context": "Developers can prepare temporary test environments quickly and remove them after an experiment. They no longer wait for a hardware purchase before every test. This improves agility.", "options": ["Temporary environments let developers test ideas without waiting for hardware.", "The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Temporary environments let developers test ideas without waiting for hardware."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-4-advanced", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which conclusion is supported by the passage?", "context": "Developers can prepare temporary test environments quickly and remove them after an experiment. They no longer wait for a hardware purchase before every test. This improves agility.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "Short experiments become easier when environments can be created and removed quickly.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Short experiments become easier when environments can be created and removed quickly."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-5-beginner", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"trade-off\" mean?", "context": "The architect compares cost, reliability and performance before selecting a design. Improving one goal may affect another. The final decision records each trade-off rather than claiming that one design is best in every situation.", "options": ["a compromise between competing goals", "a guarantee that every goal improves equally", "a list of employee account names", "a rule that cost must always be ignored"], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: a compromise between competing goals"}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d1-5-intermediate", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D1", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best summarizes the passage?", "context": "The architect compares cost, reliability and performance before selecting a design. Improving one goal may affect another. The final decision records each trade-off rather than claiming that one design is best in every situation.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "A design decision may improve one goal while affecting another.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees th