ion because its responsibility depends on the service it uses.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "Provider and customer each perform security duties.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Provider and customer each perform security duties."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d2-1-advanced", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D2", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which conclusion is supported by the passage?", "context": "The cloud provider protects its physical facilities. The customer configures access to the application and its data. The team checks the service documentation because its responsibility depends on the service it uses.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "Changing services may change which security tasks the customer performs.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 2, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Changing services may change which security tasks the customer performs."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d2-2-beginner", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D2", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"least privilege\" mean?", "context": "An analyst needs to read reports but does not need to delete them. The administrator grants only the permissions required for that work. This follows least privilege and avoids giving the analyst full administrative access.", "options": ["sharing one administrator password with everyone", "granting only the permissions needed for a task", "allowing every user to delete every report", "turning off all access checks"], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: granting only the permissions needed for a task"}, {"tag": 