ccess key in its source code. The workload obtains new credentials when needed.", "options": ["passwords that remain valid forever", "public filenames with no access function", "access details that are valid for a limited time", "copies of the application user interface"], "correctIndex": 2, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: access details that are valid for a limited time"}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d2-3-intermediate", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D2", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best summarizes the passage?", "context": "A workload assumes a role and receives credentials that expire. The team uses these temporary credentials instead of embedding a permanent access key in its source code. The workload obtains new credentials when needed.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears.", "The workload uses expiring credentials obtained through a role."], "correctIndex": 3, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: The workload uses expiring credentials obtained through a role."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d2-3-advanced", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D2", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which conclusion is supported by the passage?", "context": "A workload assumes a role and receives credentials that expire. The team uses these temporary credentials instead of embedding a permanent access key in its source code. The workload obtains new credentials when needed.", "options": ["Removing permanent keys from source code reduces exposure of long-lived secrets.", "The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Removing permanent keys from source code reduces exposure of long-lived secrets."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d2-4-beginner", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D2", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"encryption\" mean?", "context": "The team encrypts stored records and protects data sent between services. It also limits access to the keys. Encryption protects confidentiality, but the team still needs correct access permissions.", "options": ["removing all application monitoring", "making every stored record public", "replacing all user accounts with filenames", "transforming data to prevent unauthorized reading"], "correctIndex": 3, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: transforming data to prevent unauthorized reading"}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d2-4-intermediate", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D2", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best summarizes the passage?", "context": "The team encrypts stored records and protects data sent between services. It also limits access to the keys. Encryption protects confidentiality, but the team still needs correct access permissions.", "options": ["Encryption and access permissions both help protect the records.", "The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Encryption and access permissions both help protect the records."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d2-4-advanced", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D2", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which conclusion is supported by the passage?", "context": "The team encrypts stored records and protects data sent between services. It also limits access to the keys. Encryption protects confidentiality, but the team still needs correct access permissions.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "Encryption alone does not replace access control.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Encryption alone does not replace access control."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d2-5-beginner", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D2", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"audit trail\" mean?", "context": "The security team reviews records of account activity to investigate who changed a setting and when. These records provide an audit trail. They help investigations but do not automatically prevent every incorrect change.", "options": ["a record of actions that can be reviewed later", "a promise that no setting can ever change", "a collection of product advertisements", "a replacement for all permission policies"], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: a record of actions that can be reviewed later"}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d2-5-intermediate", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D2", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best summarizes the passage?", "context": "The security team reviews records of account activity to investigate who changed a setting and when. These records provide an audit trail. They help investigations but do not automatically prevent every incorrect change.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "Activity records help the team investigate configuration changes.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Activity records help the team investigate configuration changes."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d2-5-advanced", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D2", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which conclusion is supported by the passage?", "context": "The security team reviews records of account activity to investigate who changed a setting and when. These records provide an audit trail. They help investigations but do not automatically prevent every incorrect change.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "Recording an action is different from preventing that action.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 2, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Recording an action is different from preventing that action."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d3-1-beginner", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D3", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"instance\" mean?", "context": "The team launches a virtual server to run its application. It calls this server an instance. The team selects suitable capacity and manages the software running on the server.", "options": ["a running virtual server in this context", "a physical invoice for a training course", "a password shared by all users", "an archived paper diagram"], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: a running virtual server in this context"}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d3-1-intermediate", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D3", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best summarizes the passage?", "context": "The team launches a virtual server to run its application. It calls this server an instance. The team selects suitable capacity and manages the software running on the server.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The application runs on a virtual server selected by the team.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: The application runs on a virtual server selected by the team."}, {"tag"