cts identified by keys.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 2, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Images are stored as objects identified by keys."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d3-2-advanced", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D3", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which conclusion is supported by the passage?", "context": "The application saves uploaded images as objects in a bucket. Each object has a key used to retrieve it. This object storage pattern differs from attaching a disk directly to one virtual server.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears.", "The team should not treat a bucket as a disk attached to one server."], "correctIndex": 3, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: The team should not treat a bucket as a disk attached to one server."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d3-3-beginner", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D3", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"managed service\" mean?", "context": "The team chooses a database service whose provider handles routine infrastructure maintenance. The team still designs its data and controls access. A managed service reduces some operational tasks without removing every customer duty.", "options": ["a service requiring no customer decisions at all", "a database that must be printed every day", "a service where the provider handles specified operational tasks", "a server that cannot receive updates"], "correctIndex": 2, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: a service where the provider handles specified operational tasks"}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d3-3-intermediate", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D3", "level": "intermediate", "prompt": "Which statement best summarizes the passage?", "context": "The team chooses a database service whose provider handles routine infrastructure maintenance. The team still designs its data and controls access. A managed service reduces some operational tasks without removing every customer duty.", "options": ["The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears.", "The provider handles some maintenance while the team manages data and access."], "correctIndex": 3, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: The provider handles some maintenance while the team manages data and access."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d3-3-advanced", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D3", "level": "advanced", "prompt": "Which conclusion is supported by the passage?", "context": "The team chooses a database service whose provider handles routine infrastructure maintenance. The team still designs its data and controls access. A managed service reduces some operational tasks without removing every customer duty.", "options": ["Using a managed service does not remove every operational or security duty.", "The passage says that no further customer decisions are needed.", "The passage recommends ignoring changes in workload usage.", "The passage guarantees that every operational problem disappears."], "correctIndex": 0, "explanation": "Đáp án được hỗ trợ bởi đoạn văn: Using a managed service does not remove every operational or security duty."}, {"tag": "placement-v2-aws-clf-c02-d3-4-beginner", "domain": "AWS_CLF_C02_D3", "level": "beginner", "prompt": "In this passage, what does \"routing\" mean?", "context": "The network team defines rules that direct traffic to the intended destination. It reviews routing when a service cannot reach another network. A route determines where traffic goes, while permission rules determine whether traffic is allowed.", "options": ["choosing the font of a billing report", "replacing every password with a number", "removing all net